  "notes": [
    "Shift is bound to the same ability as the un-shifted key, so it cannot cycle action-bar pages. Shift-B still opens all bags. Alt is the real second layer.",
    "Blessings live on an OPie ring under Mouse 4; auras on Mouse 5. Middle-click dispels a teammate under the cursor. Ctrl+middle-click is Righteous Defense (point at the mob).",
    "Crusader Strike, Avenger's Shield, Avenging Wrath and Righteous Defense are TBC-only. Divine Plea may be Wrath-only \u2014 confirm at the trainer before trusting that slot.",
    "Righteous Fury and Redemption sit on the click-only utility bar (Bar 10), not on a key. Divine Favor is also click-only. Questie opens on the semicolon key, which is off this left-hand board.",
    "Racials are not on the default board: Draenei Gift of the Naaru goes on Alt-G, Dwarf Stoneform on Alt-Z, Blood Elf Arcane Torrent on C (it would replace Blessing of Sacrifice)."
  ],
